---
import BaseLayout from '../../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
import Navbar from '../../components/Navbar.astro';
import Footer from '../../components/Footer.astro';
---

<BaseLayout title="SQL Case Study: Nashville Housing Data Refinery | Portfolio Jakub Nicpoń">
    <Navbar />

    <main class="container">
        <header class="project-hero">
            <h1 data-translate="heroTitle">Nashville Housing Data Refinery</h1>
            <div class="section-underline centered-underline"></div>
            <p data-translate="heroDesc">
                Celem tego projektu było przeprowadzenie kompleksowego procesu ETL na zbiorze ponad 56 000 rekordów. Przekształcenie "brudnych" i niespójnych danych źródłowych za pomocą SQL w wysokiej jakości model relacyjny (star Schema), gotowy do zasilenia systemów BI.
            </p>
            <div class="nav-buttons">
                <a href="#step-1" class="btn-nav btn-primary" data-translate="btnSql">Zobacz zapytania SQL</a>
                <a href="#audit-section" class="btn-nav btn-secondary" data-translate="btnIssues">Zidentyfikowane Problemy</a>
                <a href="/assets/Nashville_Housing_Data.csv" download class="btn-nav btn-outline" data-translate="btnDownload">Pobierz pliki CSV</a>
            </div>
        </header>

        <section class="audit-section" id="audit-section">
            <h2 style="text-align: center;" data-translate="issuesTitle">Zidentyfikowane Problemy (Data Profiling)</h2>
            <div class="section-underline centered-underline"></div>
            <p style="text-align: center; color: var(--text-secondary); margin-bottom: 40px;" data-translate="issuesDesc">Analiza wykazała szereg błędów uniemożliwiających rzetelną analizę:</p>
            
            <div class="audit-grid">
                <div class="city-card">
                    <h4 data-translate="issue1Title">Brak atomowości adresów</h4>
                    <p data-translate="issue1Desc">Kolumna Property Address zawiera numer domu, nazwę ulicy i miasto w jednym ciągu tekstowym, co uniemożliwia analizę cen na poziomie konkretnych ulic czy dzielnic.</p>
                </div>
                <div class="city-card">
                    <h4 data-translate="issue2Title">Zanieczyszczone typy danych</h4>
                    <p data-translate="issue2Desc">Pola finansowe (Sale Price) zawierające znaki waluty ($) i przecinki traktowane są przez SQL jako tekst. Dodatkowo daty zapisane są w niejednolitych formatach tekstowych.</p>
                </div>
                <div class="city-card">
                    <h4 data-translate="issue3Title">Luki w danych i Duplikaty</h4>
                    <p data-translate="issue3Desc">Setki rekordów nie posiadają adresu nieruchomości (możliwego do odzyskania poprzez Parcel ID). Zbiór zawiera również powielone, identyczne transakcje sztucznie zawyżające obrót.</p>
                </div>
                <div class="city-card">
                    <h4 data-translate="issue4Title">Błędy logiczne i kategoryzacja</h4>
                    <p data-translate="issue4Desc">Przypadki, w których dom sprzedano przed datą jego budowy. Niejednolita flaga statusu (np. Y, N, Yes, No) utrudniająca budowanie metryk.</p>
                </div>
            </div>
        </section>

        <div class="sql-step" id="step-1">
            <h3 data-translate="step1Title">01. Inicjalizacja bazy i schematów</h3>
            <span class="step-description" data-translate="step1Desc">-- Utworzenie bazy, schematów (raw, staging, cleaned) dla zachowania architektury warstwowej.</span>
            <div class="code-container">
<pre><code><span class="sql-com">-- Stworzenie bazy danych</span>
<span class="sql-key">CREATE DATABASE</span> cleaning_nashville_housing;
<span class="sql-key">GO</span>
<span class="sql-key">USE</span> cleaning_nashville_housing;
<span class="sql-key">GO</span>

<span class="sql-com">-- Stworzenie schematów/etapów pracy</span>
<span class="sql-key">CREATE SCHEMA</span> raw;
<span class="sql-key">GO</span>
<span class="sql-key">CREATE SCHEMA</span> staging;
<span class="sql-key">GO</span>
<span class="sql-key">CREATE SCHEMA</span> cleaned;
<span class="sql-key">GO</span></code></pre>
            </div>
        </div>

        <div class="sql-step" id="step-2">
            <h3 data-translate="step2Title">02. Utworzenie tabeli na surowe dane (RAW)</h3>
            <span class="step-description" data-translate="step2Desc">-- Stworzenie szerokiej tabeli NVARCHAR(MAX) przyjmującej "brudne" dane bez ryzyka błędu parsowania czy ucięcia tekstu.</span>
            <div class="code-container">
<pre><code><span class="sql-key">CREATE TABLE</span> raw.housing_raw (
    <span class="sql-str">"Unnamed: 0.1"</span> <span class="sql-key">NVARCHAR</span>(<span class="sql-key">MAX</span>),
    <span class="sql-str">"Unnamed: 0"</span> <span class="sql-key">NVARCHAR</span>(<span class="sql-key">MAX</span>),
    <span class="sql-str">"Parcel ID"</span> <span class="sql-key">NVARCHAR</span>(<span class="sql-key">MAX</span>),
    <span class="sql-str">"Land Use"</span> <span class="sql-key">NVARCHAR</span>(<span class="sql-key">MAX</span>),
    <span class="sql-str">"Property Address"</span> <span class="sql-key">NVARCHAR</span>(<span class="sql-key">MAX</span>),
    <span class="sql-str">"Suite/ Condo   #"</span> <span class="sql-key">NVARCHAR</span>(<span class="sql-key">MAX</span>),
    <span class="sql-str">"Property City"</span> <span class="sql-key">NVARCHAR</span>(<span class="sql-key">MAX</span>),
    <span class="sql-str">"Sale Date"</span> <span class="sql-key">NVARCHAR</span>(<span class="sql-key">MAX</span>),
    <span class="sql-str">"Sale Price"</span> <span class="sql-key">NVARCHAR</span>(<span class="sql-key">MAX</span>),
    <span class="sql-str">"Legal Reference"</span> <span class="sql-key">NVARCHAR</span>(<span class="sql-key">MAX</span>),
    <span class="sql-str">"Sold As Vacant"</span> <span class="sql-key">NVARCHAR</span>(<span class="sql-key">MAX</span>),
    <span class="sql-str">"Multiple Parcels Involved in Sale"</span> <span class="sql-key">NVARCHAR</span>(<span class="sql-key">MAX</span>),
    <span class="sql-str">"Owner Name"</span> <span class="sql-key">NVARCHAR</span>(<span class="sql-key">MAX</span>),
    <span class="sql-str">"Address"</span> <span class="sql-key">NVARCHAR</span>(<span class="sql-key">MAX</span>),
    <span class="sql-str">"City"</span> <span class="sql-key">NVARCHAR</span>(<span class="sql-key">MAX</span>),
    <span class="sql-str">"State"</span> <span class="sql-key">NVARCHAR</span>(<span class="sql-key">MAX</span>),
    <span class="sql-str">"Acreage"</span> <span class="sql-key">NVARCHAR</span>(<span class="sql-key">MAX</span>),
    <span class="sql-str">"Tax District"</span> <span class="sql-key">NVARCHAR</span>(<span class="sql-key">MAX</span>),
    <span class="sql-str">"Neighborhood"</span> <span class="sql-key">NVARCHAR</span>(<span class="sql-key">MAX</span>),
    <span class="sql-str">"image"</span> <span class="sql-key">NVARCHAR</span>(<span class="sql-key">MAX</span>),
    <span class="sql-str">"Land Value"</span> <span class="sql-key">NVARCHAR</span>(<span class="sql-key">MAX</span>),
    <span class="sql-str">"Building Value"</span> <span class="sql-key">NVARCHAR</span>(<span class="sql-key">MAX</span>),
    <span class="sql-str">"Total Value"</span> <span class="sql-key">NVARCHAR</span>(<span class="sql-key">MAX</span>),
    <span class="sql-str">"Finished Area"</span> <span class="sql-key">NVARCHAR</span>(<span class="sql-key">MAX</span>),
    <span class="sql-str">"Foundation Type"</span> <span class="sql-key">NVARCHAR</span>(<span class="sql-key">MAX</span>),
    <span class="sql-str">"Year Built"</span> <span class="sql-key">NVARCHAR</span>(<span class="sql-key">MAX</span>),
    <span class="sql-str">"Exterior Wall"</span> <span class="sql-key">NVARCHAR</span>(<span class="sql-key">MAX</span>),
    <span class="sql-str">"Grade"</span> <span class="sql-key">NVARCHAR</span>(<span class="sql-key">MAX</span>),
    <span class="sql-str">"Bedrooms"</span> <span class="sql-key">NVARCHAR</span>(<span class="sql-key">MAX</span>),
    <span class="sql-str">"Full Bath"</span> <span class="sql-key">NVARCHAR</span>(<span class="sql-key">MAX</span>),
    <span class="sql-str">"Half Bath"</span> <span class="sql-key">NVARCHAR</span>(<span class="sql-key">MAX</span>)
);
<span class="sql-key">GO</span></code></pre>
            </div>
        </div>

        <div class="sql-step" id="step-3">
            <h3 data-translate="step3Title">03. Tabela Staging (struktura)</h3>
            <span class="step-description" data-translate="step3Desc">-- Przygotowanie tabeli roboczej ze znormalizowanymi typami danych, która przyjmie wyczyszczone wartości z tabeli raw. Dodanie kolumn na Quality Flags.</span>
            <div class="code-container">
<pre><code><span class="sql-key">CREATE TABLE</span> staging.cleaning_housing (
    UniqueID <span class="sql-key">INT</span>,
    ParcelID <span class="sql-key">NVARCHAR</span>(255),
    LandUse <span class="sql-key">NVARCHAR</span>(255),
    PropertyAddress <span class="sql-key">NVARCHAR</span>(255),
    PropertyCity <span class="sql-key">NVARCHAR</span>(255),
    PropertyState <span class="sql-key">NVARCHAR</span>(50),
    SaleDate <span class="sql-key">DATE</span>,
    SalePrice <span class="sql-key">DECIMAL</span>(15,2),
    SoldAsVacant <span class="sql-key">NVARCHAR</span>(10),
    OwnerName <span class="sql-key">NVARCHAR</span>(255),
    YearBuilt <span class="sql-key">INT</span>,
    TotalValue <span class="sql-key">DECIMAL</span>(15,2),
    Acreage <span class="sql-key">DECIMAL</span>(10,2),
    QualityFlags <span class="sql-key">NVARCHAR</span>(<span class="sql-key">MAX</span>), <span class="sql-com">-- Flagi podejrzanych wartosci</span>
    StreetNumber <span class="sql-key">NVARCHAR</span>(50),
    StreetName <span class="sql-key">NVARCHAR</span>(255)
);
<span class="sql-key">GO</span></code></pre>
            </div>
        </div>

        <div class="sql-step" id="step-4">
            <h3 data-translate="step4Title">04. Import i normalizacja danych (INSERT)</h3>
            <span class="step-description" data-translate="step4Desc">-- Przeniesienie danych z użyciem bezpiecznego CAST/CONVERT. Czyszczenie znaków walut, formatowanie dat USA oraz standaryzacja pola SoldAsVacant ('Y/N' na 'Yes/No').</span>
            <div class="code-container">
<pre><code><span class="sql-key">INSERT INTO</span> staging.cleaning_housing (UniqueID, ParcelID, LandUse, PropertyAddress, PropertyCity, PropertyState, SaleDate, SalePrice, SoldAsVacant, OwnerName, YearBuilt, TotalValue, Acreage)
<span class="sql-key">SELECT</span>
    <span class="sql-fun">TRY_CAST</span>([Unnamed: 0] <span class="sql-key">AS INT</span>), <span class="sql-com">-- nawiasy kwadratowe z powodu spacji w nagłówku</span>
    <span class="sql-fun">TRIM</span>([Parcel ID]),
    <span class="sql-fun">UPPER</span>(<span class="sql-fun">TRIM</span>([Land Use])),
    <span class="sql-fun">TRIM</span>([Property Address]),
    <span class="sql-fun">UPPER</span>(<span class="sql-fun">TRIM</span>([Property City])),
    <span class="sql-fun">UPPER</span>(<span class="sql-fun">TRIM</span>([State])),
    <span class="sql-fun">TRY_CONVERT</span>(<span class="sql-key">DATE</span>, [Sale Date], 104), <span class="sql-com">-- format dd.mm.yyyy</span>
    <span class="sql-fun">TRY_CAST</span>(<span class="sql-fun">REPLACE</span>(<span class="sql-fun">REPLACE</span>([Sale Price], <span class="sql-str">'$'</span>, <span class="sql-str">''</span>), <span class="sql-str">','</span>, <span class="sql-str">''</span>) <span class="sql-key">AS DECIMAL</span>(15,2)),
    <span class="sql-key">CASE</span>
        <span class="sql-key">WHEN</span> <span class="sql-fun">UPPER</span>(<span class="sql-fun">TRIM</span>([Sold As Vacant])) <span class="sql-key">IN</span> (<span class="sql-str">'Y'</span>, <span class="sql-str">'YES'</span>) <span class="sql-key">THEN</span> <span class="sql-str">'Yes'</span>
        <span class="sql-key">WHEN</span> <span class="sql-fun">UPPER</span>(<span class="sql-fun">TRIM</span>([Sold As Vacant])) <span class="sql-key">IN</span> (<span class="sql-str">'N'</span>, <span class="sql-str">'NO'</span>) <span class="sql-key">THEN</span> <span class="sql-str">'No'</span>
        <span class="sql-key">ELSE</span> <span class="sql-str">'Unknown'</span>
    <span class="sql-key">END</span>,
    <span class="sql-fun">UPPER</span>(<span class="sql-fun">TRIM</span>([Owner Name])),
    <span class="sql-fun">TRY_CAST</span>([Year Built] <span class="sql-key">AS INT</span>),
    <span class="sql-fun">TRY_CAST</span>([Total Value] <span class="sql-key">AS DECIMAL</span>(15,2)),
    <span class="sql-fun">TRY_CAST</span>([Acreage] <span class="sql-key">AS DECIMAL</span>(10,2))
<span class="sql-key">FROM</span> raw.housing_raw;
<span class="sql-key">GO</span></code></pre>
            </div>
         
        </div>

        <div class="sql-step" id="step-5">
            <h3 data-translate="step5Title">05. Odzyskiwanie adresów (Self-Join)</h3>
            <span class="step-description" data-translate="step5Desc">-- Uzupełnianie brakujących adresów nieruchomości poprzez wyszukanie innych transakcji dla tego samego ParcelID (identyfikatora działki).</span>
            <div class="code-container">
<pre><code><span class="sql-key">UPDATE</span> a
<span class="sql-key">SET</span> a.PropertyAddress = <span class="sql-fun">ISNULL</span>(a.PropertyAddress, b.PropertyAddress),
    a.PropertyCity = <span class="sql-fun">ISNULL</span>(a.PropertyCity, b.PropertyCity),
    a.PropertyState = <span class="sql-fun">ISNULL</span>(a.PropertyState, b.PropertyState)
<span class="sql-key">FROM</span> staging.cleaning_housing a
<span class="sql-key">JOIN</span> staging.cleaning_housing b 
    <span class="sql-key">ON</span> a.ParcelID = b.ParcelID 
    <span class="sql-key">AND</span> a.UniqueID &lt;&gt; b.UniqueID <span class="sql-com">-- ta sama dzialka, inna transakcja</span>
<span class="sql-key">WHERE</span> a.PropertyAddress <span class="sql-key">IS NULL AND</span> b.PropertyAddress <span class="sql-key">IS NOT NULL</span>;
<span class="sql-key">GO</span></code></pre>
            </div>
            
        </div>

        <div class="sql-step" id="step-6">
            <h3 data-translate="step6Title">06. Usuwanie nadmiarowych spacji</h3>
            <span class="step-description" data-translate="step6Desc">-- Iteracyjne użycie REPLACE na polach adresowych i nazwiskach, by pozbyć się podwójnych/potrójnych spacji powstałych przy błędach wprowadzania.</span>
            <div class="code-container">
<pre><code><span class="sql-com">-- Usuniecie wielu spacji miedzy slowami</span>
<span class="sql-key">UPDATE</span> staging.cleaning_housing
<span class="sql-key">SET</span>
    PropertyAddress = <span class="sql-fun">REPLACE</span>(<span class="sql-fun">REPLACE</span>(<span class="sql-fun">REPLACE</span>(<span class="sql-fun">TRIM</span>(PropertyAddress), <span class="sql-str">'  '</span>, <span class="sql-str">' '</span>), <span class="sql-str">'  '</span>, <span class="sql-str">' '</span>), <span class="sql-str">'  '</span>, <span class="sql-str">' '</span>),
    OwnerName = <span class="sql-fun">REPLACE</span>(<span class="sql-fun">REPLACE</span>(<span class="sql-fun">REPLACE</span>(OwnerName, <span class="sql-str">'  '</span>, <span class="sql-str">' '</span>), <span class="sql-str">'  '</span>, <span class="sql-str">' '</span>), <span class="sql-str">'  '</span>, <span class="sql-str">' '</span>)
<span class="sql-key">WHERE</span> PropertyAddress <span class="sql-key">IS NOT NULL OR</span> OwnerName <span class="sql-key">IS NOT NULL</span>;
<span class="sql-key">GO</span></code></pre>
            </div>
        </div>

        <div class="sql-step" id="step-7">
            <h3 data-translate="step7Title">07. Rozbicie adresów (CHARINDEX)</h3>
            <span class="step-description" data-translate="step7Desc">-- Wyodrębnienie numeru budynku oraz nazwy ulicy do osobnych kolumn za pomocą wyszukiwania pierwszej spacji.</span>
            <div class="code-container">
<pre><code><span class="sql-com">-- Rozbicie adresu na ulice i numer domu</span>
<span class="sql-key">UPDATE</span> staging.cleaning_housing
<span class="sql-key">SET</span>
    StreetNumber =
        <span class="sql-key">CASE</span>
            <span class="sql-key">WHEN</span> <span class="sql-fun">CHARINDEX</span>(<span class="sql-str">' '</span>, PropertyAddress) &gt; 0 <span class="sql-com">-- znajdz chociaz 1 spacje</span>
            <span class="sql-key">THEN</span> <span class="sql-fun">LEFT</span>(PropertyAddress, <span class="sql-fun">CHARINDEX</span>(<span class="sql-str">' '</span>, PropertyAddress) - 1)
            <span class="sql-key">ELSE NULL END</span>,
    StreetName =
        <span class="sql-key">CASE</span>
            <span class="sql-key">WHEN</span> <span class="sql-fun">CHARINDEX</span>(<span class="sql-str">' '</span>, PropertyAddress) &gt; 0
            <span class="sql-key">THEN</span> <span class="sql-fun">TRIM</span>(<span class="sql-fun">SUBSTRING</span>(PropertyAddress, <span class="sql-fun">CHARINDEX</span>(<span class="sql-str">' '</span>, PropertyAddress) + 1, <span class="sql-fun">LEN</span>(PropertyAddress)))
            <span class="sql-key">ELSE</span> PropertyAddress <span class="sql-key">END</span>
<span class="sql-key">WHERE</span> PropertyAddress <span class="sql-key">IS NOT NULL</span>;
<span class="sql-key">GO</span></code></pre>
            </div>
        </div>

        <div class="sql-step" id="step-8">
            <h3 data-translate="step8Title">08. Flagi Jakości (Data Quality)</h3>
            <span class="step-description" data-translate="step8Desc">-- Oznaczanie podejrzanych anomalii: sprzedaż domu przed jego rokiem budowy oraz sprzedaż poniżej 10% całkowitej wartości rynkowej (Total Value).</span>
            <div class="code-container">
<pre><code><span class="sql-key">UPDATE</span> staging.cleaning_housing
<span class="sql-key">SET</span> QualityFlags = <span class="sql-fun">ISNULL</span>(QualityFlags + <span class="sql-str">'; '</span>, <span class="sql-str">''</span>) + <span class="sql-str">'FUTURE_SALE_ERROR'</span>
<span class="sql-key">WHERE</span> SaleDate &lt; <span class="sql-fun">DATEFROMPARTS</span>(YearBuilt, 1, 1);

<span class="sql-key">UPDATE</span> staging.cleaning_housing
<span class="sql-key">SET</span> QualityFlags = <span class="sql-fun">ISNULL</span>(QualityFlags + <span class="sql-str">'; '</span>, <span class="sql-str">''</span>) + <span class="sql-str">'SUSPICIOUS_LOW_PRICE'</span>
<span class="sql-key">WHERE</span> SalePrice &lt; (TotalValue * 0.1);
<span class="sql-key">GO</span></code></pre>
            </div>
        </div>

        <div class="sql-step" id="step-9">
            <h3 data-translate="step9Title">09. Normalizacja Land Use</h3>
            <span class="step-description" data-translate="step9Desc">-- Redukcja niespójnych i ręcznie wpisywanych kategorii użycia gruntu do ujednoliconych głównych worków (CONDO, SINGLE FAMILY, VACANT LAND).</span>
            <div class="code-container">
<pre><code><span class="sql-key">UPDATE</span> staging.cleaning_housing
<span class="sql-key">SET</span> LandUse = <span class="sql-key">CASE</span>
    <span class="sql-key">WHEN</span> LandUse <span class="sql-key">LIKE</span> <span class="sql-str">'%CONDO%'</span> <span class="sql-key">THEN</span> <span class="sql-str">'CONDO'</span>
    <span class="sql-key">WHEN</span> LandUse <span class="sql-key">LIKE</span> <span class="sql-str">'%SINGLE FAMILY%'</span> <span class="sql-key">THEN</span> <span class="sql-str">'SINGLE FAMILY'</span>
    <span class="sql-key">WHEN</span> LandUse <span class="sql-key">LIKE</span> <span class="sql-str">'%VACANT%'</span> <span class="sql-key">THEN</span> <span class="sql-str">'VACANT LAND'</span>
    <span class="sql-key">ELSE</span> <span class="sql-str">'OTHER'</span>
<span class="sql-key">END</span>;
<span class="sql-key">GO</span></code></pre>
            </div>
        </div>

        <div class="sql-step" id="step-10">
            <h3 data-translate="step10Title">10. Model Wymiarowy (Tabela Lokalizacji)</h3>
            <span class="step-description" data-translate="step10Desc">-- Wyciągnięcie unikalnych adresów z tabeli faktów do osobnej tabeli wymiarowej z auto-inkrementowanym kluczem w celu odciążenia wielkości bazy.</span>
            <div class="code-container">
<pre><code><span class="sql-key">CREATE TABLE</span> cleaned.dimension_location (
    LocationKey <span class="sql-key">INT IDENTITY</span>(1,1) <span class="sql-key">PRIMARY KEY</span>,
    City <span class="sql-key">NVARCHAR</span>(100),
    State <span class="sql-key">NVARCHAR</span>(50),
    StreetName <span class="sql-key">NVARCHAR</span>(255),
    StreetNumber <span class="sql-key">NVARCHAR</span>(50)
);

<span class="sql-key">INSERT INTO</span> cleaned.dimension_location (City, State, StreetName, StreetNumber)
<span class="sql-key">SELECT DISTINCT</span> PropertyCity, PropertyState, StreetName, StreetNumber
<span class="sql-key">FROM</span> staging.cleaning_housing
<span class="sql-key">WHERE</span> StreetName <span class="sql-key">IS NOT NULL</span>;
<span class="sql-key">GO</span></code></pre>
            </div>
            
        <div class="sql-step" id="step-11">
            <h3 data-translate="step11Title">11. Tabela Faktów i deduplikacja (ROW_NUMBER)</h3>
            <span class="step-description" data-translate="step11Desc">-- Wykrywanie duplikatów z użyciem ROW_NUMBER (te same transakcje dla działki). Łączenie kluczy wymiarów w docelową tabelę 'fact_sales'.</span>
            <div class="code-container">
<pre><code><span class="sql-key">WITH</span> No_Duplicates <span class="sql-key">AS</span> (
    <span class="sql-key">SELECT</span> *,
        <span class="sql-fun">ROW_NUMBER</span>() <span class="sql-fun">OVER</span> (
        <span class="sql-fun">PARTITION BY</span> ParcelID, PropertyAddress, SalePrice, SaleDate
        <span class="sql-key">ORDER BY</span> UniqueID) <span class="sql-key">as</span> rn
    <span class="sql-key">FROM</span> staging.cleaning_housing
)
<span class="sql-key">SELECT</span>
    nd.UniqueID,
    nd.SaleDate,
    nd.SalePrice,
    nd.TotalValue,
    nd.YearBuilt,
    nd.OwnerName,
    nd.QualityFlags,
    l.LocationKey
<span class="sql-key">INTO</span> cleaned.fact_sales
<span class="sql-key">FROM</span> No_Duplicates nd
<span class="sql-key">LEFT JOIN</span> cleaned.dimension_location l
    <span class="sql-key">ON</span> l.City = nd.PropertyCity
    <span class="sql-key">AND</span> <span class="sql-fun">ISNULL</span>(l.State, <span class="sql-str">''</span>) = <span class="sql-fun">ISNULL</span>(nd.PropertyState, <span class="sql-str">''</span>)
    <span class="sql-key">AND</span> l.StreetName = nd.StreetName
    <span class="sql-key">AND</span> <span class="sql-fun">ISNULL</span>(l.StreetNumber, <span class="sql-str">''</span>) = <span class="sql-fun">ISNULL</span>(nd.StreetNumber, <span class="sql-str">''</span>)
<span class="sql-key">WHERE</span> nd.rn = 1;
<span class="sql-key">GO</span></code></pre>
            </div>
        </div>

        <div class="sql-step" id="step-12">
            <h3 data-translate="step12Title">12. Finalny widok analityczny (View)</h3>
            <span class="step-description" data-translate="step12Desc">-- Utworzenie widoku łączącego fakty i wymiary, udostępniającego przeliczone metryki (np. wiek w momencie sprzedaży) gotowe pod zasilenie Power BI.</span>
            <div class="code-container">
<pre><code><span class="sql-key">CREATE OR ALTER VIEW</span> cleaned.final <span class="sql-key">AS</span>
<span class="sql-key">SELECT</span>
    f.UniqueID,
    f.SaleDate <span class="sql-key">as</span> Sale_Date,

    <span class="sql-com">-- Rozbicie adresu</span>
    l.StreetName <span class="sql-key">as</span> Street_Name,
    l.StreetNumber <span class="sql-key">as</span> Street_Number,
    l.City <span class="sql-key">as</span> City,
    l.State <span class="sql-key">as</span> State,
    f.OwnerName <span class="sql-key">as</span> Owner_Name,

    <span class="sql-com">-- Finanse</span>
    f.SalePrice <span class="sql-key">as</span> Sale_Price,
    f.TotalValue <span class="sql-key">as</span> Total_Value,
    f.SalePrice - f.TotalValue <span class="sql-key">as</span> Price_vs_Tax_Value,

    <span class="sql-com">-- Wiek nieruchomosci</span>
    f.YearBuilt <span class="sql-key">as</span> Year_Built,
    <span class="sql-fun">YEAR</span>(f.SaleDate) - f.YearBuilt <span class="sql-key">as</span> Property_Age_At_Sale,

    <span class="sql-com">-- Jakość danych</span>
    <span class="sql-key">CASE</span>
        <span class="sql-key">WHEN</span> f.QualityFlags <span class="sql-key">IS NULL THEN</span> <span class="sql-str">'Verified'</span>
        <span class="sql-key">WHEN</span> f.QualityFlags <span class="sql-key">LIKE</span> <span class="sql-str">'%FUTURE_SALE_ERROR%'</span> <span class="sql-key">THEN</span> <span class="sql-str">'Sold before built'</span>
        <span class="sql-key">WHEN</span> f.QualityFlags <span class="sql-key">LIKE</span> <span class="sql-str">'%SUSPICIOUS_LOW_PRICE%'</span> <span class="sql-key">THEN</span> <span class="sql-str">'Valuation Warning: Price too low'</span>
        <span class="sql-key">ELSE</span> <span class="sql-str">'Review Needed'</span>
    <span class="sql-key">END as</span> Data_Quality_Status

<span class="sql-key">FROM</span> cleaned.fact_sales f
<span class="sql-key">JOIN</span> cleaned.dimension_location l <span class="sql-key">ON</span> f.LocationKey = l.LocationKey;
<span class="sql-key">GO</span>

<span class="sql-key">SELECT</span> * <span class="sql-key">FROM</span> cleaned.final;</code></pre>
            </div>
            
        </div>
</div>
